#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.5.0-beta.1.rst:4
msgid "v3.5.0-beta.1"
msgstr "v3.5.0-beta.1"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.5.0-beta.1.rst:6
msgid ""
"v3.5.0-beta.1 updates the core to **MicroPython 1.11** and fixes SPI, USB "
"HID, and low-power / SDIO issues. The MicroPython bump is a behavior change "
"— read the breaking changes below. (This is the first beta leading up to "
":ref:`v3.5.0 <changelog_v3_5_0>`.)"
msgstr ""
"v3.5.0-beta.1 memperbarui inti ke **MicroPython 1.11** dan memperbaiki "
"masalah SPI, USB HID, serta low-power / SDIO. Pembaruan MicroPython "
"merupakan perubahan perilaku — baca perubahan yang merusak di bawah ini. "
"(Ini adalah beta pertama menuju :ref:`v3.5.0 <changelog_v3_5_0>`\\ .)"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.5.0-beta.1.rst:14
msgid "On this page"
msgstr "Di halaman ini"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.5.0-beta.1.rst:17
msgid "Highlights"
msgstr "Sorotan"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.5.0-beta.1.rst:19
msgid "**MicroPython 1.11** — the bundled core was updated."
msgstr "**MicroPython 1.11** — inti bawaan telah diperbarui."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.5.0-beta.1.rst:20
msgid ""
"**Fixes** — SPI WFI bug, USB HID descriptor, and low-power / SDIO init."
msgstr ""
"**Perbaikan** — bug SPI WFI, deskriptor USB HID, dan inisialisasi low-power "
"/ SDIO."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.5.0-beta.1.rst:21
msgid ""
"**Breaking:** MicroPython was updated to 1.11 — see the breaking changes."
msgstr ""
"**Perubahan Merusak:** MicroPython diperbarui ke 1.11 — lihat perubahan yang"
" merusak."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.5.0-beta.1.rst:24
msgid "Other changes and improvements"
msgstr "Perubahan dan peningkatan lainnya"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.5.0-beta.1.rst:26
msgid ""
"Updated the bundled MicroPython to 1.11; stopped tracking firmware binaries "
"in the repository and moved the WINC1500 firmware."
msgstr ""
"Memperbarui MicroPython bawaan ke 1.11; menghentikan pelacakan biner "
"firmware di repositori dan memindahkan firmware WINC1500."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.5.0-beta.1.rst:30
msgid "Bug fixes"
msgstr "Perbaikan bug"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.5.0-beta.1.rst:32
msgid ""
"Fixed the SPI WFI bug and added SPI buffer checks, the USB HID descriptor, "
"suspending SysTick before entering stop mode, and resetting SDIO before "
"init."
msgstr ""
"Memperbaiki bug SPI WFI dan menambahkan pemeriksaan buffer SPI, deskriptor "
"USB HID, menghentikan SysTick sebelum memasuki stop mode, dan mereset SDIO "
"sebelum inisialisasi."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.5.0-beta.1.rst:37
msgid "Breaking API changes"
msgstr "Perubahan API yang merusak"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.5.0-beta.1.rst:39
msgid ""
"User-visible API breaks between v3.4.3 and v3.5.0-beta.1. Scope: Python "
"C-modules in ``modules/`` and Python libraries in ``scripts/libraries/``."
msgstr ""
"Perubahan API yang terlihat pengguna antara v3.4.3 dan v3.5.0-beta.1. "
"Cakupan: C-modul Python di ``modules/`` dan pustaka Python di "
"``scripts/libraries/``\\ ."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.5.0-beta.1.rst:42
msgid ""
"The breaking change is a *behavior* change (same API, different results) — "
"re-check affected scripts. Each commit hash links to its diff on GitHub."
msgstr ""
"Perubahan yang merusak adalah perubahan *perilaku* (API sama, hasil berbeda)"
" — periksa kembali skrip yang terpengaruh. Setiap hash commit tertaut ke "
"diff-nya di GitHub."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.5.0-beta.1.rst:48
msgid "MicroPython updated to 1.11 *(behavior)*"
msgstr "MicroPython diperbarui ke 1.11 *(perilaku)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.5.0-beta.1.rst:50
msgid ""
"The bundled MicroPython core was updated to 1.11. Standard-library and "
"language behavior follows upstream MicroPython 1.11; re-check scripts that "
"depend on version-specific :mod:`micropython` / standard-module behavior."
msgstr ""
"Inti MicroPython bawaan diperbarui ke 1.11. Perilaku pustaka standar dan "
"bahasa mengikuti MicroPython 1.11 upstream; periksa kembali skrip yang "
"bergantung pada perilaku :mod:`micropython` / modul standar yang spesifik "
"untuk versi tertentu."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.5.0-beta.1.rst:54
msgid ""
"*Commits:* `5676b4101 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/5676b4101>`__"
msgstr ""
"*Commit:* `5676b4101 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/5676b4101>`__"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.5.0-beta.1.rst:59
msgid "Migration checklist"
msgstr "Daftar periksa migrasi"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.5.0-beta.1.rst:61
msgid ""
"Re-validate scripts that depend on version-specific MicroPython behavior "
"against 1.11 (:ref:`the MicroPython bump <v3_5_0_beta_1_micropython>`). All "
"other scripts run unchanged."
msgstr ""
"Validasi ulang skrip yang bergantung pada perilaku MicroPython spesifik "
"versi terhadap 1.11 (\\ :ref:`pembaruan MicroPython "
"<v3_5_0_beta_1_micropython>`\\ ). Semua skrip lainnya berjalan tanpa "
"perubahan."
